	abstract = {The simplistic, linear, and largely interpretable depiction of the Earth Observation value chain that is enshrined in the currently used scheme of “Processing Levels” should be retired and replaced by a well-defined, versatile, harmonized, and easily understandable matrix. The proposed approach of disentangling measurand and geometric processing steps has the potential to not only booster interoperability in multisource production processes, but also to allow targeted standardization and to optimise workflows with respect to uncertainty tracing and data quality control.},
